      "id": "word-cita--citation",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "cita",
      "answerEn": "citation; source reference",
      "noteEn": "Cita can also mean an appointment or a quotation. In writing and research, it can name the reference that identifies a source supporting a claim.",
      "example": {
        "es": "El informe incluye una cita de una fuente fiable.",
        "en": "The report includes a citation from a reliable source."
      },
      "tags": [
